cury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house." width="1000" height="665" class="trustpilot__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-03e10e28><a href="#skip-reviews" class="trustpilot__skip" data-v-03e10e28>skip reviews</a><div class="trustpilot__widget trustpilot-widget trustpilot-slice" data-locale="en-GB" data-template-id="53aa8912dec7e10d38f59f36" data-businessunit-id="620fbe077a2b86af5e54e1a2" data-style-height="140px" data-style-width="100%" data-theme="light" data-stars="4,5" data-review-languages="en" data-font-family="Poppins" data-v-03e10e28><a href="https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/www.evri.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-03e10e28> Trustpilot </a></div></div><span id="skip-reviews" data-v-03e10e28></span></section><section id="evri-on-sustainability" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="default-slice" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri on sustainability<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As responsible carriers, we’re leading the way for sustainability in our industry. We already have award-winning solutions and huge targets like net-zero emissions to meet by 2035. Everyone who sends parcels with Evri is supporting our journey t